{"3861080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drink Up, Cowboy!", "steam_appid": 3861080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike cowboy bartending game where you use your trusty revolver to make drinks, and take out troublemakers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hard-earned cash to upgrade your skills and customize your saloon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861080/extras/8d4af84fad1859ac37073b3b602e16e7.poster.avif?t=1781288603\" aria-label=\"A showcase of the core gameplay loop including making drinks &amp;amp; using your revolver\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861080/extras/8d4af84fad1859ac37073b3b602e16e7.webm?t=1781288603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay good attention to customer orders! Some cowboys want more complex drinks, like a shaken glass of Tumbleweed Juice with ice after a hard day’s work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone’s antsy in town! If you get an order wrong or take too long, keep your trusty revolver at the ready to take out anyone tumbleweed-brained enough to point theirs at you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861080/extras/bb3faed05f3680ae21b91f9c22eee5af.poster.avif?t=1781288603\" aria-label=\"A showcase of the upgrade trees and the Ride-thru horse upgrade\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861080/extras/bb3faed05f3680ae21b91f9c22eee5af.webm?t=1781288603\" type=\